{"ID":"20240314091937-w6ry640","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091937-w6ry640","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091937-w6ry640\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164429-p9q6frp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164429-8cpkrwq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164429-8cpkrwq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:14,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:14\u0026#125;","title":"【茵陈蒿汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422164429-p9q6frp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-p9q6frp","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谷疸之病，寒热不食，食即头眩，心胸不安，久久发黄为谷疸，茵陈蒿汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-g7xoj8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-g7xoj8b","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈蒿汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-03501wn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-03501wn","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈蒿六两，栀子十枚，大黄二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-40ru7kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-40ru7kb","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水一斗，先煮茵陈减六升，纳二味煮取三升，去滓分温三服。小便当利，尿如皂角汁状，色正赤，一宿腹减，黄从小便去也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-ytrnh5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-ytrnh5m","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在开始要讲处方，前面讲病因的时候原因很多，有人喝酒喝多了，有人是内因啊，有人是外感啊，讲了半天，就是发黄就对了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-torafww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-torafww","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240408161002-nry2nzv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-qkd6dwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-qkd6dwh","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那好，你如果是不懂中药，你如果发黄，我举个例，我把它放大，人体的图不是这样子的，我把它放大给你看，这个是你的胆（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这个是你的肝，如果你的胆道被堵到了，胆汁会回流产生全身发黄，堵到的原因很多，可能是蛔虫堵到，可能是石头堵到，可能是一些痰饮，炎症，太多的痰或者脾脏的湿过来堵到了，因此胆汁无法排出来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆汁没有办法排出来的时候，你小肠里面缺少了胆汁以后当然大便就不会很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你如果给西医看，胆结石堵到了，拿掉算了，他这边开一刀，那边开一刀，因为上面一条神经通到心包，这个总胆管在这里，这个部分，跟肝连接在一起的部分是不能开刀的，因为这里动脉很多，一开刀一出血的话，病人就很危险了。本来你有石头堵到了，你还有胆，对不对？医生说这个石头堵掉了，胆囊拿掉，拿掉以后你从此没有胆了，所以拿掉以后比没拿掉更没有胆（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师应该是指胆气胆量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），懂不懂我意思啊？他们很矛盾的想法，拿掉以后从此是终生堵到，不拿掉的话还有胆，只是石头堵到，那石头堵到的原因很多啊，很多人喜欢吃内脏，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可是吃内脏好不好呢？其实很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，像你吃肝脏，有啥不好？我常常叫女孩子吃。美国人很喜欢吃牛肝，牛肝做成牛肝排，切成厚厚一片片在超级市场卖，直接在锅上煎一煎，当牛排吃了，还不用煎熟。那男的女的都喜欢，吃肝真的能补血，对肝很好，可是他们不知道如何保养，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你吃这种内脏的东西，你要加点醋，醋可以把胆清干净"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可是他没有加醋，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不喜欢吃酸的人最容易得到胆道里面堵塞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你如果拿掉胆，没有胆了，这个胆汁还是会在这边累积，以我的经验，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最快 15 年，最慢 20 年"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有超过的，当然有例外，但是一般在这段时间中间，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个胆汁累积在这里日久以后，慢慢变成硬的像铁片一样，一发病的时候，病人痛一个晚上，在地上打滚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你到医院去看的时候，可能三个医生有三个结果，肝硬化，肝癌。实际上是什么？这个病人过去胆没有了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为胆没有了，我们称肝结石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以你以为胆结石拿掉了就没事了，没关系，那你以后就面临"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝结石，更难清出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，在更里面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆结石还好清，肝结石难清"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这种都是肝胆方面的问题，那如果你会用后面那个处方，再稍微加点药，石头就可以排掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-2ekh4l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-2ekh4l6","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240408162023-2mo9zn5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-kh2du4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-kh2du4m","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一个我们遇到的黄疸的病，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寒热不食"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，什么东西都吃不下去，一吃头就昏，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为胃已经不纳谷了，整个中焦梗到了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个是肝胆胃，这个已经顶到了，食物下不去了，当然不能吃东西了，一吃东西头就昏，浊气往上升，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心胸不安"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，沼气一直往上升呐，当然胸口很难过，如果不治疗，久久就会发黄，全身发黄。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈蒿汤主之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们治疗肝病和胆病，有几个药一定要会用，所以药性你要很了解，才能敢下重手"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-dnt9krq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-dnt9krq","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个就是茵陈篙"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个茵陈篙呢，你要在用它的观念里面，你的脑海里要这么想，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈蒿专门是用来去黄和去湿，他这个黄无论你是阳黄还是阴黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就像大黄只去实，不管你是寒的还是热的，都可以用大黄。茵陈不管你是你是阴黄还是阳黄，它的目的就是去黄，这样子想就好。这样想你就会用处方了，它又可以去湿，为啥可以去黄？就是因为这个黄是湿引起的，所以你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄疸病你不会用茵陈，你根本没办法治这个病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以不管你是急性肝炎，里面的病西医判断你是急性肝炎，猛爆型肝炎，猛爆型肝炎实际上不存在，这个病其实是西药引起的，现在慢慢承认了什么西药引起猛爆性肝炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-jeb1whj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-jeb1whj","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你遇到急性的胆堵塞或者是胆囊发炎，无所谓，都可以用到这个药，所以当你在用茵陈的时候，我们知道他是黄，尤其是阳黄，去的很快，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个药，他的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"功能是专去肝胆的湿热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄呢，去实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个处方就是这三味药，临床上用的很多，效果真的很快。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-9803w7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-9803w7r","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果手不太锐利，茵陈三钱，栀子两钱，大黄一钱，这个吃个十天不会好，大概要吃个三个月，慢慢好起来。碰到我就不一样了，我一看到体格很高大，茵陈一两，栀子六钱，大黄两钱，这个剂量是有比例的，大黄量最小，茵陈最高，你如果中等身材，150 磅，140 磅，茵陈用六钱，栀子用四钱或三钱，大黄两钱或一钱半，看他便秘到啥程度，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你重用的时候效果和你轻用完全不一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为你没有重用过，你不知道，重用下去以后，病人完全发生的按照这个症状...三味药你拿六碗水煮成两碗，分两次服，分三次也无所谓，你九碗水煮成三碗，分三次也无所谓。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃了以后小便当利，真的是小便像皂角汁一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，皂角汁是深咖啡色，像咖啡色一样排出来，一宿就腹减，肚子整个就消掉，大便出来好爽，可是你如果下手不够重，方子是对的，剂量不够，他会慢慢好起来，但是你处方剂量很够，一剂！"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-zefkvix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-zefkvix","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以诸位不要怕，这个很标准的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的便秘。病人一进来就全身黄，大便好不好？便秘，舌头看看，黄的，结束了，已经结束了，处方开好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164429-8cpkrwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164429-8cpkrwq","updated":"20240422164429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个是经方的第一方治疗黄疸。"}]}]}